@prefix eco: <https://ggen.dev/ecosystem#> . @prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> . eco:TransportFailureEvidence a skos:Concept; skos:inScheme eco:VerificationEvidenceScheme; skos:prefLabel "Transport Failure Evidence"; skos:definition "Evidence of a transport/materialization failure without conflating connector visibility with a mounted tree." .